            parts = listOf(
                StoryPart(1, "A Blank Wall", listOf(
                    "The wall beside the school library had been repainted plain cream after an old noticeboard was removed. The art club wanted to create a mural, but the head teacher said the wall belonged to the whole school and any design needed broad approval. Nosa suggested asking students what they wanted the wall to communicate.",
                    "The club prepared an anonymous idea board with prompts about kindness, teamwork, learning, and the future. They did not ask students to share private experiences. Within a week, the board filled with simple suggestions: return borrowed books, include someone in a game, ask before using another person's things, and keep trying when work is difficult."
