                StoryPart(8, "A Small Repair", listOf(
                    "Several weeks later, a corner of the mural was scratched by a moving display stand. The club reported it to the facilities manager rather than trying to repaint it without permission. Staff checked the surface and arranged a small repair using the stored colour references.",
                    "Nosa added a note to the maintenance log about keeping heavy stands away from the wall. The incident was not treated as a reason to blame anyone. It became a practical reminder that shared artwork needed protection and clear arrangements."
