                StoryPart(10, "More Than Paint", listOf(
                    "At the end of term, Nosa looked at the tree and its branches of small promises. The mural had not solved every problem in the school, and it did not need to. It reminded students of actions they could choose each day and gave the building a shared piece of art.",
